## Predictions (written before the run)
- station holds: the station arm's mean distance stays under 8 while control drifts past 20 as the pack forages
- leader holds: followers stay within ~4 of the leader; mean distance under 6; the leader itself wanders
- nudge holds: mean distance saw-tooths: rises between passes, falls at each; never above ~15 at a sample
- DF ignores wild station and following: station and leader arms look like control; only the nudge differs

